WEBVTT

00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:12.030
Can you imagine...

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:17.370
...a life in which you could
never touch the one you love?

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:20.210
He takes the life of whatever he touches.

00:00:20.210 --> 00:00:23.670
That was the curse the witch put on him.

00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:27.960
Plants, animals... and people
are no exception, of course.

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:31.380
Regarding her son, doomed to live his life
without knowing the warmth of another,

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:34.050
his mother only complained.

00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:36.560
"That child is like Death incarnate..."

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:37.560
she said.

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:45.190
This occurred to me earlier, but...

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:48.110
...something about your
maid uniform bothers me.

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:51.490
Would you care to have a look?

00:00:51.490 --> 00:00:53.660
You're already showing it off!

00:00:53.660 --> 00:00:55.200
What I meant was...

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:58.660
...your shoulders and all are too exposed,
and I don't think it's appropriate.

00:00:58.660 --> 00:01:00.330
Can't you wear something more normal?

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:01.460
Normal...

00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:04.630
You mean, like this?

00:01:04.630 --> 00:01:06.750
No, this is too sexy in its own right!

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:08.420
And what's with the picture boards?!

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:09.710
All right, then how about this?

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:11.930
No maid would pose like that!

00:01:11.930 --> 00:01:14.220
All right, then starting tomorrow
I just won't wear anything at all.

00:01:14.220 --> 00:01:16.050
How did you jump to that conclusion?!

00:02:46.020 --> 00:02:50.020
Episode 6

00:02:47.940 --> 00:02:49.900
Just look at this!

00:02:49.900 --> 00:02:53.690
Since it's cold out, I thought I'd do some
reading in the conservatory, but...

00:02:53.690 --> 00:02:55.450
...the place is an utter mess!

00:02:57.240 --> 00:02:59.070
I'm terribly sorry.

00:02:59.070 --> 00:03:03.620
Both Rob and I had completely
forgotten about this place.

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:08.460
I realize two servants are just not
enough for a mansion this big.

00:03:08.460 --> 00:03:11.710
Let's leave what was here
originally and get rid of the rest.

00:03:11.710 --> 00:03:13.380
I'll give you a hand.

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:15.170
Thank you, Your Grace.

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:16.170
All right...

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:18.930
...then let's use these.

00:03:18.930 --> 00:03:22.430
Have you got a link to hyperspace or
something between your breasts?

00:03:23.310 --> 00:03:26.690
It's amazing how thick
the greenery has gotten.

00:03:26.690 --> 00:03:29.770
Though once I expose them
to the power of my curse,

00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:32.110
it doesn't really matter
how much they've grown.

00:03:34.030 --> 00:03:36.570
My curse obeys certain rules.

00:03:36.570 --> 00:03:40.030
Any organism that touches me will die.

00:03:41.240 --> 00:03:44.080
Touching me over my clothes
will produce the same result.

00:03:44.080 --> 00:03:49.040
Because I've taken the utmost precautions,
I've never caused anyone's death.

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:50.750
Though...

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:54.880
...I have taken the lives
of many small creatures.

00:03:55.920 --> 00:04:01.390
Still, since I started living here, I've
come to learn what's safe and what's not.

00:04:01.390 --> 00:04:03.310
Living things can get
infinitesimally close to me...

00:04:03.310 --> 00:04:06.730
...and be fine, as long as they
don't come in direct contact.

00:04:06.730 --> 00:04:11.650
If my clothing is thick enough,
they can touch me and be okay.

00:04:11.650 --> 00:04:14.650
They can touch objects that I'm
in contact with and be all right.

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:20.110
It doesn't appear to pose any problems
if my sweat or spittle gets on them.

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:22.700
I can grab onto their clothing.

00:04:22.700 --> 00:04:25.660
But I hardly ever do that
because it's too risky.

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:31.330
These rules were made solely at
the whim of the witch who cursed me.

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:32.790
In other words,

00:04:32.790 --> 00:04:36.840
from that day on I have
lived under her control.

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:41.050
Oh, I'd better check on Alice...

00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:46.720
What are you looking at? Flowers?

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:49.890
Yes. They've blossomed so beautifully.

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:53.560
But I've enjoyed them enough.

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:55.270
Would you wither them for me?

00:04:55.270 --> 00:04:56.520
Huh? Are you sure?

00:04:56.520 --> 00:05:00.650
Yes. I'll be over there tidying up.

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:01.660
Alice...

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:13.960
Alice!

00:05:17.550 --> 00:05:18.920
A garland?

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:21.300
Uh-huh, I made it just now!

00:05:21.300 --> 00:05:25.220
I thought it'd be a shame to just wither
them, so I turned them into dried flowers.

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:28.010
This way you'll be able to enjoy
them for a while longer.

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:30.350
Dried flowers, you say?

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:34.060
I can't vouch for their quality, though...

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:35.980
Thank you so much.

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:38.480
It's one more thing for me to treasure.

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:40.820
I'm such a lucky girl.

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:43.780
I'm so glad you like it.

00:05:43.780 --> 00:05:47.830
I won't be under your
control forever, witch.

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:51.500
On the night of the next blood moon,
we're thinking of taking you...

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:54.620
...to a gathering of witches
called the witches' sabbath.

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:56.040
If I go to the witches' sabbath,

00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:59.500
I may find some leads
on how to break my curse.

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:01.920
If I can break it,

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:04.260
Mother will accept me.

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:06.550
I'll be able to go home.

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:09.220
And dine with my family again...

00:06:11.730 --> 00:06:15.560
No, I'm sure by then that Mother will...

00:06:27.450 --> 00:06:28.740
Viola?

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:31.830
You haven't been dining with us lately.

00:06:31.830 --> 00:06:33.910
What have you been up to?

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:37.250
I've been going to a friend's house.

00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:41.840
As an aristocrat's daughter, you must
take care to act in moderation.

00:06:41.840 --> 00:06:43.300
You understand, don't you?

00:06:43.300 --> 00:06:44.340
Yes.

00:06:59.770 --> 00:07:02.400
Darn it. I can't sleep.

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:06.070
Oh!

00:07:06.070 --> 00:07:07.530
Stop that!

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:08.530
Alice?!

00:07:10.280 --> 00:07:11.870
Alice, what's wrong?

00:07:11.870 --> 00:07:14.450
Oh, Your Grace!

00:07:14.450 --> 00:07:17.500
Forgive me.
I was taking a shower.

00:07:18.920 --> 00:07:22.340
Thank goodness you came
to my aid, Your Grace.

00:07:22.340 --> 00:07:23.210
Your Grace?

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:25.470
I am one with the floor.
I didn't see anything.

00:07:25.470 --> 00:07:27.050
Anything at all.

00:07:28.260 --> 00:07:30.260
A cat in the shower room?

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:35.600
Yes. It slipped in, and before I knew it,
it had run off with my dressing gown.

00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:38.270
I had just washed my maid uniform, so...

00:07:38.270 --> 00:07:40.440
In that case, leave it to me.

00:07:40.440 --> 00:07:42.690
I just need to get your gown
back from the cat, right?

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:44.780
You wait here and take your shower, okay?

00:07:44.780 --> 00:07:46.240
Your Grace?

00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:47.490
Thank you so much.

00:07:47.490 --> 00:07:49.950
I'm just doing what any
gentleman would do.

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:53.490
I'll come back as soon as I find it.

00:07:53.490 --> 00:07:54.580
All right.

00:07:54.580 --> 00:07:56.330
You don't have to tag along, you know!

00:07:56.330 --> 00:07:57.620
You'll catch a chill!

00:07:57.620 --> 00:08:00.630
Yes, but this was the result
of my carelessness,

00:08:00.630 --> 00:08:04.250
and since there's a cat involved,
I think I'd better come along.

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:05.880
Well, you've got a point there.

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:07.260
Okay, but you should...

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:14.260
...wear this at least. It may be a little
big for you, but it's better than nothing.

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:16.810
It smells like you, Your Grace.

00:08:16.810 --> 00:08:19.600
You don't have to tell me what you think.
Let's get moving.

00:08:23.440 --> 00:08:28.360
It's hard looking for a black cat in
the dark like this, don't you think?

00:08:28.360 --> 00:08:29.740
Uh, yeah...

00:08:29.740 --> 00:08:35.040
It's dragging my gown behind it,
so I doubt it's gotten very far.

00:08:35.040 --> 00:08:36.330
Uh, right...

00:08:36.330 --> 00:08:39.870
I can't take in anything she says.

00:08:39.870 --> 00:08:41.960
Would you like to touch them?

00:08:41.960 --> 00:08:43.790
It's okay, you know.

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:45.710
No, it's not that, it's...

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:49.010
There it is! The cat!

00:08:49.010 --> 00:08:50.430
Come on, let's go after it!

00:08:50.430 --> 00:08:51.260
Alice!

00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:54.180
Right now, I'd like to talk
with you, Your Grace.

00:08:54.180 --> 00:08:56.350
Have you forgotten what we're here for?!

00:09:00.190 --> 00:09:02.690
Thankfully we caught it, but...

00:09:02.690 --> 00:09:05.520
My gown's all chewed up.

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:10.700
This cat has kittens, so it must've wanted
to take some cloth back to its nest.

00:09:10.700 --> 00:09:14.950
You can't wear that anymore.
You should go out and buy a new one.

00:09:14.950 --> 00:09:19.830
This gown was my favorite because you told
me how good it looked on me, Your Grace.

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:21.120
That outfit looks nice.

00:09:22.210 --> 00:09:26.340
To think she remembered that casual
remark I made... Is she pure or what?

00:09:27.710 --> 00:09:30.260
This is for you.

00:09:30.260 --> 00:09:31.630
Come again sometime.

00:09:36.140 --> 00:09:39.680
Thank you for your help, Your Grace.

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:43.900
My maid uniform is dry now,
so I can wear it back to my room.

00:09:43.900 --> 00:09:47.980
You must be chilly. Why don't you take
another shower before you go to bed?

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:50.190
All right. Would you care to join me?

00:09:50.190 --> 00:09:51.900
As if!

00:09:51.900 --> 00:09:54.200
Then let me give you your jacket back.

00:09:54.200 --> 00:09:56.870
No, no, you can do that tomorrow!

00:09:56.870 --> 00:09:58.830
Anyhow, see you tomorrow!

00:09:58.830 --> 00:10:00.700
Try not to catch a cold or anything.

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:01.710
Good night!

00:10:03.710 --> 00:10:08.130
Though I always feel so lonely
at this precise moment.

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:20.930
Good night, Your Grace.

00:10:35.160 --> 00:10:36.910
And who might you be?

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:42.370
Nobody dodgy.

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:44.120
We came to take the Duke
to the witches' sabbath.

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:49.130
Darn it all!

00:10:49.130 --> 00:10:51.130
Cuff and Zain will be here any minute.

00:10:51.130 --> 00:10:53.970
Which stuff should I leave here?

00:10:53.970 --> 00:10:56.510
You're awfully calm.

00:10:56.510 --> 00:10:58.180
We're going to a witches'
gathering, you know.

00:10:58.180 --> 00:10:59.550
Aren't you scared?

00:10:59.550 --> 00:11:01.930
No, not particularly.

00:11:01.930 --> 00:11:04.020
I'm even taking some gifts for them.

00:11:04.020 --> 00:11:05.100
Tuna and what not.

00:11:05.100 --> 00:11:08.560
Do you think these witches
are cats or something?

00:11:08.560 --> 00:11:10.980
Oh, Alice? Are you in here?

00:11:10.980 --> 00:11:12.690
Cuff! Zain!

00:11:12.690 --> 00:11:14.490
What's with all the useless garbage?

00:11:14.490 --> 00:11:16.320
You don't need any of it
at the witches' sabbath.

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:21.080
You're not in any danger as long
as they don't find out you're human.

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:23.040
Leave that junk here.

00:11:23.040 --> 00:11:24.830
Did you really need to burn it?

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:26.000
Nope.

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:29.210
May I come along to tonight's
witches' sabbath as well?

00:11:29.210 --> 00:11:30.080
SNo problem.

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:31.500
You aren't taking this seriously enough!

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:34.380
Witches' gatherings are scary,
aren't they?

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:36.760
How can you be so casual about it?

00:11:36.760 --> 00:11:39.970
The gatherings certainly are scary.
But relax.

00:11:39.970 --> 00:11:42.060
I'm here to protect you, Alice.

00:11:42.060 --> 00:11:43.270
What about me?!

00:11:45.680 --> 00:11:50.150
But... why are the two of them
helping me out like this?

00:11:50.150 --> 00:11:52.940
If the others found out they brought
humans to the witches' sabbath,

00:11:52.940 --> 00:11:56.240
their own standing would be compromised.

00:11:56.240 --> 00:11:59.110
Okay, it looks like we can
use this to get there easily.

00:11:59.110 --> 00:12:01.280
Cuff, give them the robes.

00:12:01.280 --> 00:12:02.280
Sure thing.

00:12:03.830 --> 00:12:06.500
Those robes will mask your human stench
as long as you've got them on.

00:12:06.500 --> 00:12:09.960
We'll claim that you're my
younger brother and sister.

00:12:09.960 --> 00:12:11.250
So act accordingly.

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:12.500
O-Okay.

00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:19.930
Stick with me, Alice.

00:12:19.930 --> 00:12:20.800
Whoa!

00:12:19.930 --> 00:12:22.510
Quit acting cool and get a move on!

00:12:22.510 --> 00:12:24.600
Your Grace, let's go.

00:12:24.600 --> 00:12:25.430
Yeah...

00:12:25.430 --> 00:12:26.810
Your Grace?

00:12:26.810 --> 00:12:28.810
Will you be all right?

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:30.980
Don't worry, Rob.

00:12:30.980 --> 00:12:33.570
Alice is coming with me,
and we'll both come back safely.

00:12:33.570 --> 00:12:36.320
Then I wish you good luck!

00:12:47.580 --> 00:12:49.500
Be careful, Alice.

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:06.970
Witches...

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:11.810
...aren't all like Cuff or Zain.

00:13:12.730 --> 00:13:16.230
They look like downright monsters.

00:13:18.320 --> 00:13:20.860
Alice, a-a-a-are you all right?

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:22.860
I'm here for you, you know!

00:13:22.860 --> 00:13:25.280
Are you all right, Your Grace?

00:13:25.280 --> 00:13:28.330
I wonder, could she be here?

00:13:28.330 --> 00:13:30.620
The witch that cursed me, that is.

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:35.460
Say, mister, could you grab that?

00:13:40.090 --> 00:13:42.300
Thanks, mister!

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:43.930
Hey, I haven't seen you before.

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:48.720
His Grace has completely locked up.

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:49.600
Come on, hang in there.

00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:51.890
This does not bode well...

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:54.480
Is everyone here now?

00:14:07.580 --> 00:14:10.000
Okay then, let's begin!

00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:12.120
Witch on night duty, please do the honors.

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:13.330
All rise!

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:15.830
Bow!

00:14:15.830 --> 00:14:18.170
Good evening, everyone!

00:14:19.380 --> 00:14:22.380
Witches are more courteous than I thought.

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:24.510
Okay, time to take attendance.

00:14:24.510 --> 00:14:25.260
Beto?

00:14:25.260 --> 00:14:26.010
Yes, ma'am!

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:26.800
Lloyd?

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:27.760
He's got a cold.

00:14:27.760 --> 00:14:28.590
Elle?

00:14:28.590 --> 00:14:31.350
She's not here because her
grandma's visiting.

00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:35.060
Um, Daleth. That's me, so... Present.

00:14:35.850 --> 00:14:37.810
Daleth's our leader.

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:40.570
Rumor has it she's quite a looker
underneath that mask.

00:14:40.570 --> 00:14:41.570
You don't say.

00:14:41.570 --> 00:14:43.070
Keto and Teto?

00:14:43.070 --> 00:14:44.490
What's up?

00:14:44.490 --> 00:14:45.280
Zain?

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:47.530
Yes, I'm here!

00:14:47.530 --> 00:14:49.160
Cuff?

00:14:49.160 --> 00:14:50.040
Here.

00:14:50.040 --> 00:14:54.160
It's not like you to come
to a witches' sabbath.

00:14:54.160 --> 00:14:56.120
Who are those two you brought with you?

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:57.710
Well, uh...

00:14:57.710 --> 00:14:59.590
They're my siblings, got it?

00:14:59.590 --> 00:15:02.630
Yeah. They're Zain's and my kids!

00:15:05.340 --> 00:15:06.760
I knew it!

00:15:06.760 --> 00:15:08.420
Congratulations!

00:15:06.760 --> 00:15:09.930
Why did you freak out and
say such a stupid thing?

00:15:09.930 --> 00:15:11.220
I'm shorry!

00:15:11.220 --> 00:15:13.890
Please don't blame her so harshly, Father.

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:15.690
Call me Daddy!

00:15:15.690 --> 00:15:17.230
Your kids, huh?

00:15:17.230 --> 00:15:19.150
That's great! This should be interesting.

00:15:19.150 --> 00:15:21.900
This evening's attendance is good, too.
I'm really happy about that.

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:25.450
At least for now, they haven't
figured out we're human, I hope?

00:15:25.450 --> 00:15:27.990
All right, it's time for our first report.

00:15:27.990 --> 00:15:32.200
Yesterday, a flower blossomed on the
mandrake that we've all been growing.

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:33.910
Isn't it adorable?

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:36.290
Unfortunately, it seems we'll
have to wait a little longer...

00:15:36.290 --> 00:15:38.960
...for the poisonous Budgett's
frog eggs to hatch.

00:15:38.960 --> 00:15:42.250
And anyone who would like to chip
in to buy a Voodoo doll...

00:15:42.250 --> 00:15:44.710
...should apply by the
next witches' sabbath.

00:15:44.710 --> 00:15:46.380
Yes, ma'am.

00:15:46.380 --> 00:15:49.090
I'm so glad this turned out to be
such a laid-back meeting.

00:15:49.090 --> 00:15:50.800
Me, too.

00:15:50.800 --> 00:15:53.970
Okay, this ends tonight's
witches' sabbath.

00:15:53.970 --> 00:15:55.270
What? Already?

00:15:58.520 --> 00:16:00.060
All right, dismissed.

00:16:02.900 --> 00:16:04.230
Wh-What should we do?

00:16:04.230 --> 00:16:05.860
The witches' sabbath has ended.

00:16:05.860 --> 00:16:09.030
And we still haven't found
any leads into my curse.

00:16:11.830 --> 00:16:14.950
I was amazed to hear you had kids, Zain.

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:16.080
Did you knock her up?

00:16:16.080 --> 00:16:17.290
Yep.

00:16:17.290 --> 00:16:19.370
Don't you say another word.

00:16:19.370 --> 00:16:22.210
Honestly, what the heck were you thinking?

00:16:22.210 --> 00:16:24.670
Cuff's got human blood
running through her veins.

00:16:29.760 --> 00:16:32.430
Cuff's a respectable witch.

00:16:32.430 --> 00:16:33.850
Now apologize to her.

00:16:34.890 --> 00:16:35.930
Uh, well...

00:16:38.520 --> 00:16:41.060
Sorry, Cuff. It was a slip of the tongue.

00:16:41.060 --> 00:16:43.610
No problem, just so long as you know.

00:16:43.610 --> 00:16:45.730
Having said that...

00:16:45.730 --> 00:16:47.530
...let's kick this ball around!

00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:50.320
Y-You want me to play, too?

00:16:50.320 --> 00:16:52.780
Of course, my boy!

00:16:52.780 --> 00:16:54.530
Yay!

00:16:56.370 --> 00:16:59.080
And so, we meet again, Alice.

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:00.670
You knew it was me?

00:17:00.670 --> 00:17:04.210
Well, yeah.
I'm good at remembering faces.

00:17:04.210 --> 00:17:06.210
Whoa! He blocked it with his face!

00:17:06.210 --> 00:17:10.180
So, you won Zain and Cuff
over and came to see me.

00:17:10.180 --> 00:17:11.720
What exactly do you want?

00:17:11.720 --> 00:17:16.010
I wanted to know whether my mother
had any connection with you witches.

00:17:16.010 --> 00:17:18.730
Well, I'm not really sure.

00:17:18.730 --> 00:17:23.360
I was only a slight acquaintance
of your mother's.

00:17:23.360 --> 00:17:25.440
Alice, do you have a handkerchief?

00:17:25.440 --> 00:17:26.610
The ball hit me in the face...

00:17:26.610 --> 00:17:27.690
Oh, dear!

00:17:31.450 --> 00:17:32.950
You two seem to be pretty close.

00:17:32.950 --> 00:17:34.530
Are you an item?

00:17:34.530 --> 00:17:36.620
N-No, we aren't, but...

00:17:36.620 --> 00:17:37.790
...does it look that way?

00:17:37.790 --> 00:17:40.370
You've grown quite a bit...

00:17:40.370 --> 00:17:43.500
...in spite of your curse.

00:17:43.500 --> 00:17:45.500
You... know who I am?

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:50.260
Yes, I saw you at that aristocrat's
mansion when you were little.

00:17:50.260 --> 00:17:54.340
And of course, I also know about
the witch that cursed you.

00:17:54.340 --> 00:17:56.350
Who is she?

00:17:56.350 --> 00:18:00.140
Please, let us meet her.
We'd like her to break the curse.

00:18:00.140 --> 00:18:02.190
I can't. It's impossible.

00:18:02.190 --> 00:18:03.770
But why?

00:18:03.770 --> 00:18:04.940
She's dead.

00:18:06.150 --> 00:18:11.070
And I have absolutely no idea
how to break your curse.

00:18:11.070 --> 00:18:13.610
H-How did she die?

00:18:13.610 --> 00:18:15.780
So, the curse doesn't break
when the witch dies?

00:18:15.780 --> 00:18:18.160
What did she curse me for?

00:18:18.160 --> 00:18:20.830
Oh, you've got so many questions.

00:18:20.830 --> 00:18:23.370
She was a whiz at magic.

00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:26.330
And she died because of it.

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:29.250
Let us speak of this no more.

00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:31.260
I despise her.

00:18:31.260 --> 00:18:32.470
B-But!

00:18:32.470 --> 00:18:34.220
One word of advice.

00:18:34.220 --> 00:18:39.510
The curse you've got is unlike anything
some run-of-the-mill witch could cast.

00:18:39.510 --> 00:18:43.100
I suggest that you give up now.

00:18:43.100 --> 00:18:44.060
Darn that's hot!

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:45.350
What'd you do that for?

00:18:45.350 --> 00:18:47.400
Your Grace, if you don't
have your robe on...

00:18:50.110 --> 00:18:52.490
I smell a human.

00:18:52.490 --> 00:18:53.610
It's a human.

00:18:53.610 --> 00:18:54.700
A human.

00:18:54.700 --> 00:18:56.780
Wh-What do we do now?

00:18:56.780 --> 00:18:58.700
Let's run back to the mirror.

00:19:00.950 --> 00:19:01.870
A human?

00:19:01.870 --> 00:19:03.540
Yeah, that's what they say.

00:19:03.540 --> 00:19:04.620
Don't let them get away!

00:19:06.670 --> 00:19:09.880
You're like, totally gonna be
pet food for my magic plant!

00:19:15.800 --> 00:19:17.390
Alice, are you all right?

00:19:17.390 --> 00:19:19.600
Y-Yes, Your Grace.

00:19:23.600 --> 00:19:24.600
Oh. My. Gosh. It's totally dead!

00:19:24.600 --> 00:19:26.060
Like, why?!

00:19:29.860 --> 00:19:30.890
Don't let them get away!

00:19:30.890 --> 00:19:31.650
After them!

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:36.660
Zain! Cuff! Get back here!

00:19:36.660 --> 00:19:38.740
Why are you siding with the humans?

00:19:38.740 --> 00:19:41.910
Come back! Come back, I say!

00:19:44.830 --> 00:19:47.370
W-We're safe...

00:19:49.380 --> 00:19:51.960
Cuff, Zain, I'm sorry.

00:19:51.960 --> 00:19:54.800
You did this for me.
I don't know how to thank you.

00:19:57.130 --> 00:19:59.430
They were freakin' pissed!

00:19:59.430 --> 00:20:01.680
Ooh, they had me scared!

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:04.850
We're always fighting like that,
so don't worry about it.

00:20:04.850 --> 00:20:06.890
They'll forget about it in no time.

00:20:06.890 --> 00:20:10.150
And this way we won't have to go to
another witches' sabbath for a while.

00:20:10.150 --> 00:20:14.360
I'd take on every witch in
the witches' world for you, Alice.

00:20:14.360 --> 00:20:15.440
Are you hurt?

00:20:15.440 --> 00:20:16.740
No, not a scratch.

00:20:17.400 --> 00:20:18.990
Why don't you take another trip?

00:20:18.990 --> 00:20:21.240
Don't make me go back there!

00:20:18.990 --> 00:20:22.910
You were really great back there,
Your Grace.

00:20:22.910 --> 00:20:25.160
Well, it all happened so fast...

00:20:25.160 --> 00:20:28.210
You protected me, Your Grace,
and saved my life.

00:20:28.210 --> 00:20:29.370
Thank you.

00:20:29.370 --> 00:20:30.670
N-No problem.

00:20:30.670 --> 00:20:34.250
So, did you get any leads?

00:20:34.250 --> 00:20:35.170
Yeah.

00:20:35.170 --> 00:20:38.300
I was able to learn some stuff
from that witch Daleth.

00:20:38.300 --> 00:20:41.180
It wound up being bleaker
than I'd hoped, but...

00:20:41.180 --> 00:20:43.260
...now I understand the situation.

00:20:43.260 --> 00:20:44.720
And I couldn't have
done it without you two.

00:20:44.720 --> 00:20:45.810
Thanks.

00:20:45.810 --> 00:20:48.060
I see. That's great.

00:20:48.060 --> 00:20:51.810
Why have you been helping
me out so much, Cuff?

00:20:51.810 --> 00:20:53.480
We haven't known each other for very long,

00:20:53.480 --> 00:20:56.280
and there's nothing in it for you,
being a witch and all.

00:20:56.280 --> 00:20:59.280
Well, I'm not sure I know
the reason why, but...

00:20:59.280 --> 00:21:03.240
...when I met you that day
for the first time...

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:06.240
...and saw you going all-out
for someone else's sake,

00:21:06.240 --> 00:21:08.790
I decided I wanted to be friends with you.

00:21:08.790 --> 00:21:13.750
I-I feel the same way. I hope I can
be friends with you and Zain.

00:21:13.750 --> 00:21:14.580
Really?

00:21:14.580 --> 00:21:16.550
Oh, this is so easy.

00:21:19.380 --> 00:21:22.220
Starting next time,
we'll come over as friends.

00:21:22.220 --> 00:21:23.050
See you again!

00:21:23.050 --> 00:21:24.050
So long, Alice!

00:21:24.050 --> 00:21:25.510
Ouch!

00:21:26.470 --> 00:21:28.060
As friends...

00:21:29.480 --> 00:21:31.650
Friends! Did you hear that, Alice?

00:21:31.650 --> 00:21:33.150
I've got friends!

00:21:33.150 --> 00:21:36.570
Seeing you happy makes me
happy, too, Your Grace.

00:21:36.570 --> 00:21:39.190
I don't know what will become of my curse.

00:21:39.190 --> 00:21:42.990
But I'm sure I'll get to
the truth of the matter.

00:21:42.990 --> 00:21:46.910
Thanks for sticking with me.
I hope I can continue to rely on you.

00:21:46.910 --> 00:21:50.330
Certainly. Let's break your
curse whatever happens.

00:21:50.330 --> 00:21:54.170
It's tough never being able
to touch the one you love.

00:21:54.170 --> 00:21:55.920
S-Same here.

00:21:55.920 --> 00:21:57.420
Would you like to touch me?

00:21:57.420 --> 00:21:59.880
Of all things I could touch,
why'd you pick your breasts?

00:21:59.880 --> 00:22:02.010
What about your hands or your hair?

00:22:02.010 --> 00:22:05.010
Besides, I can't touch them anyway!

00:22:05.890 --> 00:22:07.760
I can't just walk in on them now...

00:23:42.360 --> 00:23:46.570
"The Duke's and Alice's Uneventful Day."
